<title>UKRAINE: Ukraine to issue T-bills on January 28.</title>
<headline>Ukraine to issue T-bills on January 28.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ukraine's central bank will auction three-month, six-month, nine-month and 12-month discount treasury bills on January 28, a central bank official said on Monday.</p>
<p>The issue volume of each maturity was set at five million hryvnias, the head of the bank's market and exchange department, Vitaly Migashko, told Reuters.</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
